{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  During a difficult period, I started drawing patterns on canvases \u2014 just like I used to doodle in the margins of my notebooks as a kid. It helped me calm down. A year later, that habit became a game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/035fdae6712fe53ebc62143a663e2d44.poster.avif?t=1774524210\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/035fdae6712fe53ebc62143a663e2d44.webm?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/035fdae6712fe53ebc62143a663e2d44.mp4?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music is a core part of Beat Brush. In most music games, you follow the rhythm \u2014 but here it works the other way around. The music adapts to how you draw. The game tracks brush position, movement direction, and other parameters. It creates the feeling that you're not just drawing \u2014 you're painting music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/1036d94b8e5154c4454e47788353291e.poster.avif?t=1774524210\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/1036d94b8e5154c4454e47788353291e.webm?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/1036d94b8e5154c4454e47788353291e.mp4?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of notebook margins, the game has dozens of canvases. Each with its own visual style, mood, and sound. Together they tell the story of a girl named Mia, who burned out at work \u2014 and found herself again through creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to know how to draw. You don't need to know how to compose music. Just draw any patterns and unwind. And in between \u2014 decorate your studio, take care of your cat, and meet the visitors who come to buy your art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/f57d6b5436ebcf5d75927541e42c521b.poster.avif?t=1774524210\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/f57d6b5436ebcf5d75927541e42c521b.webm?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/f57d6b5436ebcf5d75927541e42c521b.mp4?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3780050?t=1774524210","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/d3468c0ac9fe021f1b726935b4abeb2206c5ad8d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774524210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/bdac5ae59e5e5eb2c98962d6eac559046cd2fb4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774524210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/bdac5ae59e5e5eb2c98962d6eac559046cd2fb4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774524210","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  During a difficult period, I started drawing patterns on canvases \u2014 just like I used to doodle in the margins of my notebooks as a kid. It helped me calm down. A year later, that habit became a game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/035fdae6712fe53ebc62143a663e2d44.poster.avif?t=1774524210\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/035fdae6712fe53ebc62143a663e2d44.webm?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/035fdae6712fe53ebc62143a663e2d44.mp4?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music is a core part of Beat Brush. In most music games, you follow the rhythm \u2014 but here it works the other way around. The music adapts to how you draw. The game tracks brush position, movement direction, and other parameters. It creates the feeling that you're not just drawing \u2014 you're painting music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/1036d94b8e5154c4454e47788353291e.poster.avif?t=1774524210\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/1036d94b8e5154c4454e47788353291e.webm?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/1036d94b8e5154c4454e47788353291e.mp4?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of notebook margins, the game has dozens of canvases. Each with its own visual style, mood, and sound. Together they tell the story of a girl named Mia, who burned out at work \u2014 and found herself again through creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to know how to draw. You don't need to know how to compose music. Just draw any patterns and unwind. And in between \u2014 decorate your studio, take care of your cat, and meet the visitors who come to buy your art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/f57d6b5436ebcf5d75927541e42c521b.poster.avif?t=1774524210\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/f57d6b5436ebcf5d75927541e42c521b.webm?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/extras/f57d6b5436ebcf5d75927541e42c521b.mp4?t=1774524210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Kesha Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780050/0b3828b5511d22fad353d01c45d7d8f745cc1313/header.jpg?t=1774524210","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3780050/1277283563/e2a68e3a16b00b95e991907d4c1b2e150c631c73/1772457362/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772458232","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3780050/1277283563/e2a68e3a16b00b95e991907d4c1b2e150c631c73/1772457362/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772458232","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3780050/1277283563/e